# Scans are several GB and stay local (back them up outside Git).
# Only the maps are tracked, so any page can be downloaded again with tools/digitarq.py:
# fontes/livros.tsv (folder -> reference code -> docId) and each folder's ids.txt (page -> fileId).
# Files already tracked from the first commits stay tracked.
fontes/**
!fontes/**/
!fontes/**/ids.txt
!fontes/livros.tsv
!fontes/godim.html
!fontes/books_8011.txt
*.tif
.playwright-mcp/
